Classes: CLR, PAL, SHD, WAR

Autoskill: Yes

This ability uses a shield to bash your current target, giving a chance to stun. The AC of the shield impacts the damage amount.

Bash will double and triple attack based on your skill.

Macro command: <code>/doability Bash</code>

Large races (Ogre, Troll, Barbarian) gain access to the related ability [[Slam]], which can be used without a shield. If you do have a shield equipped and possess the Bash skill, Slam will use the shield's AC when calculating damage.

Bash shares the same cooldown as [[Skill_Slam|Slam]].

